  {
    "udt_error_enum_v0": {
      "doc": "Numbered from 100 so the range never overlaps the Stellar Asset Contract's\\nown codes (1-10). `settle` and the escrow paths cross-invoke the token, so a\\ncaller reading `Error(Contract, #N)` off a failed Swap call cannot otherwise\\ntell whose error it is \\xe2\\x80\\x94 and rendering a token's `BalanceError` as a Swap\\npricing complaint sends the user to fix a field that was never wrong.\\n\\nThe numbering is a compatibility surface: the app maps these to messages and\\nto HTTP statuses, so a deployed instance that numbers them differently cannot\\nbe served alongside a current one. Append new codes, never renumber.",
      "lib": "",
      "name": "ContractError",
